<title>HONG KONG: ONFEM 1996 year profit HK$64.15 mln.</title>
<headline>ONFEM 1996 year profit HK$64.15 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   22.49	vs  32.53</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    10.0	 vs  5.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  26.45 gain vs  36.92 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    64.15	vs  91.59</p>
<p>    Turnover		     3,857.34   vs  3,055.55</p>
<p>    Company name		 ONFEM Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 28 to June 2</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 27</p>
<p>NOTE - ONFEM Holdings engages in property investment, development and management.</p>
<p>The company proposed a one-for-one bonus issue.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$54.05 million on disposal of investments, gain of HK$19.91 million on disposal of properties held for sale, loss of HK$40.71 million on disposal of an associated company and loss of HK$6.80 million arising from theft.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year-end to December 31 from March 31. Comparative figures are for nine months ended December 31, 1995.  </p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 12.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 2.5 cents) vs 7.5 cents for the nine-month period.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
